---
// Who builds ScadaBench, in the owner's words. No names or numbers we cannot back up.
interface Props { tone?: 'dark' | 'paper'; }
const { tone = 'dark' } = Astro.props;
---
<section class:list={['built section', tone === 'paper' && 'paper']} aria-labelledby="built-title">
  <div class="wrap card reveal">
    <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="text">
      <span class="eyebrow">Who builds it</span>
      <h2 id="built-title">Built by experienced SCADA and protection engineers.</h2>
      <p>We built ScadaBench after too many factory tests spent waiting for relays, gateways and test sets
        to arrive. It is the bench we wanted: open the SCD, press Run, and test the SCADA the same day.</p>
      <p>Every feature on this site works in the app today. Anything that doesn't yet is marked as roadmap.
        Questions or a protocol you need? <a href="/contact/">Talk to us</a>; an engineer answers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .built { padding-block: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); }
  .card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px); align-items: start; }
  .text { display: grid; gap: 14px; max-width: 70ch; }
  h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); }
  p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.06rem; }
  .paper p { color: var(--paper-muted); }
  a { color: inherit; font-weight: 600; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } img { width: 44px; height: 44px; } }
</style>
